/book/book/

# Key material must never reach a commit, whatever path it is dropped at: the
# development signing keys under datad/build/dev-keys, and any TLS-inspection
# CA or private key an operator points the build at. These are catch-all
# patterns rather than specific paths precisely because the paths are
# configurable.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.gpg
*-ca.crt
